{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WildType is an easy-to-use typing software designed to improve your typing speed and experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Experience a Different Kind of Typing</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adding more wild and uninhibited special effects and ratings to your daily typing makes typing less tedious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Improve Your Typing Skills</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your typing skills with built-in typing exercises and typing games, and compete on global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Record your typing info</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The typing calendar displays and tallies your typing info, helping you better plan your typing schedule</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Retro and Understated Desktop-Window Style</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In version 0.0.5, a new desktop-window mode was introduced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a 90s-inspired desktop style and new retro fonts and colors,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >create a retro and understated typing atmosphere, helping you enjoy the pure joy of typing.</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3410040?t=1758450919","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3410040?t=1758450919","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410040/e48f8d9b8d5f79e2dfd0f2271b5b77033111ae43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758450919","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410040/e48f8d9b8d5f79e2dfd0f2271b5b77033111ae43/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758450919","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3420610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WildType is an easy-to-use typing software designed to improve your typing speed and experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Experience a Different Kind of Typing</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adding more wild and uninhibited special effects and ratings to your daily typing makes typing less tedious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Improve Your Typing Skills</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your typing skills with built-in typing exercises and typing games, and compete on global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Record your typing info</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The typing calendar displays and tallies your typing info, helping you better plan your typing schedule</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Retro and Understated Desktop-Window Style</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In version 0.0.5, a new desktop-window mode was introduced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a 90s-inspired desktop style and new retro fonts and colors,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >create a retro and understated typing atmosphere, helping you enjoy the pure joy of typing.</p>","developers":["xianrenak"],"genres":[{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410040/a35b3a1eddeb5767bc32c1ab073e6a227d094a46/header.jpg?t=1758450919","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recomme